        "release_date": "1980-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
        "description": "Motion Soccer brings football to virtual reality with unmatched freedom. Switch between three views and control methods to experience each match your way.\n\n1. **Tactical View (Mixed Reality)**  \n   Place a miniature field in your real space. Watch the game without intervening, adjust tactics and lineups, or move players with your hand. Prefer the classic style? Use joysticks and aim with your gaze.\n\n2. **Third-Person View**  \n   Feel like you're in a traditional football simulator, but inside VR. Move your players with the joystick and enjoy the 360° stadium depth.\n\n3. **First-Person View**  \n   Step onto the field. Use the joystick to dribble, pass, and shoot with ease, or challenge yourself with the expert mode: move the player’s feet with your hands to create impossible plays.\n\nChoose from 100 teams (50 clubs and 50 national teams), upgrade your players and customize names, appearances, and attributes. Play friendlies, compete in 5 tournaments, relive iconic moments in story mode, and master your skills with 18 training challenges. Climb the ranks and leave your mark on the records.",
